      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": null,
      "numeric_id": null,
      "original_position": 19,
      "content": "让我在已解析的官方原文里精确检索一遍\"创业投资/创投/股权投资/风险投资\"等关键词。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_1e64618d1f98:609af92e",
